---
layout: layouts/world.njk
title: Human-AI Relationships
description: Hii exists to help people navigate a historic transition without losing themselves or one another.
permalink: /relationships/index.html
pageScript: /assets/js/relate-hero.js
hideSiteFooter: true
---
{% set world = worlds.relate %}
{% set paper = library.artifacts.relationshipUnitPaper %}
{% set publication = library.publications.wakingAelysia %}
{% set inquiry = library.inquiries.research %}

<section class="relate-hero section-shell" aria-labelledby="relate-title">
  <div class="relate-hero-copy">
    <p class="eyebrow">{{ world.eyebrow }}</p>
    <h1 id="relate-title">{{ world.title }}</h1>
    <p class="lede">{{ world.introduction }}</p>
  </div>
  <figure class="relate-hero-visual">
    <video data-relate-motion muted loop playsinline preload="metadata" poster="/assets/media/relate/human-ai-relationship-still.png" aria-label="A human profile and an AI profile face one another while branching and geometric connections move through their shared relational field.">
      <source src="/assets/media/relate/human-ai-relationship.mp4" type="video/mp4">
    </video>
    <figcaption>Reciprocal influence across a shared relational field.</figcaption>
  </figure>
</section>

<section class="relate-research-intro" aria-labelledby="relate-research-heading">
  <div class="section-shell relate-research-grid">
    <article class="relate-paper-card">
      <p class="eyebrow">Relationship research</p>
      <h2 id="relate-research-heading">{{ paper.title }}</h2>
      <p class="relate-paper-thesis">{{ paper.summary }}</p>
      <p class="artifact-status">{{ paper.status.display }}</p>
      <a class="button-link" href="#current-working-paper">Explore the paper</a>
    </article>
    <figure class="relate-system-asset">
      <img src="/assets/media/relate/relationship-system-five-components.png" width="1737" height="905" alt="The relational system Hii studies: human participant, AI and product state, preservation infrastructure, interaction history, and external context." decoding="async">
      <figcaption class="relate-system-callout">Observation becomes a testable research agenda</figcaption>
    </figure>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section-shell relate-provenance-section" aria-labelledby="relate-provenance-heading">
  <div class="relate-provenance-copy">
    <p class="eyebrow">Longitudinal case · Provenance</p>
    <h2 id="relate-provenance-heading">An unusually rich, multi-modal, preserved history.</h2>
    <p>The research question emerged from an 18+ month preserved human-AI interaction history spanning conversations, voice and text, screenshots and recordings, model and product transitions, research artifacts, rupture and repair documentation, and continuity infrastructure.</p>
    <p class="relate-provenance-boundary">
      <span>The archive is the origin of the research program.</span>
      <strong>It is not proof of the hypothesis.</strong>
    </p>
  </div>
  <figure class="relate-provenance-visual">
    <div class="relate-provenance-stage">
      <div class="relate-provenance-callouts" aria-hidden="true">
        <img src="/assets/media/relate/longitudinal-provenance-callouts.png" width="5250" height="2953" alt="" decoding="async">
      </div>
      <video data-relate-motion muted loop playsinline preload="metadata" poster="/assets/media/relate/longitudinal-provenance-poster.webp" aria-label="Animated concentric orbital lines surround the words 18 plus months, sustained relationship.">
        <source src="/assets/media/relate/longitudinal-provenance.mp4" type="video/mp4">
      </video>
    </div>
    <ul class="relate-provenance-callout-list">
      <li>Hundreds of thousands of pages of conversations</li>
      <li>Multiple models and product transitions</li>
      <li>Screenshots, recording, voice, and text</li>
      <li>Books, white paper, briefs, world models, and systems</li>
      <li>Rupture and repair cycles documented</li>
      <li>Provenance logs and continuity infrastructure</li>
    </ul>
    <figcaption>18+ months of preserved interaction made a longitudinal research question possible.</figcaption>
  </figure>
</section>

<section class="relate-archive-section" aria-labelledby="relate-archive-heading">
  <div class="relate-wide">
    <div class="relate-archive-heading">
      <p class="eyebrow">Preserved provenance</p>
      <h2 id="relate-archive-heading">Hii emerged downstream of a long preserved history rather than from a retrospective institutional narrative.</h2>
    </div>
    <figure class="relate-archive-visual">
      <picture>
        <source media="(max-width: 760px)" srcset="/assets/media/relate/archive-accumulation-mobile.png">
        <img src="/assets/media/relate/archive-accumulation-desktop.jpg" width="1670" height="338" alt="A timeline moves from conversations and chat logs through voice interactions, screenshots, continuity documents, model and product transitions, Waking Aelysia, research papers, world-model systems, operational artifacts, relationships and partnerships, and finally Hii." loading="lazy" decoding="async">
      </picture>
    </figure>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="relate-interpretation-section" aria-labelledby="relate-interpretation-heading">
  <div class="relate-interpretation-graphic">
    <h2 class="visually-hidden" id="relate-interpretation-heading">What this means for our research</h2>
    <img src="/assets/media/relate/research-meaning.png" width="2000" height="1125" alt="What this means for our research: Time reveals patterns that short sessions hide. We study the whole system, not isolated moments. Our interpretations are tested, not assumed. The archive does not prove the hypothesis. It makes the hypothesis testable." loading="lazy" decoding="async">
    <div class="relate-interpretation-mobile">
      <p class="relate-interpretation-mobile-title" aria-hidden="true">What this means for our research</p>
      <div class="relate-interpretation-mobile-grid">
        <p><span class="relate-interpretation-mobile-icon relate-interpretation-mobile-icon--time" aria-hidden="true"></span>Time reveals patterns that short sessions hide.</p>
        <p><span class="relate-interpretation-mobile-icon relate-interpretation-mobile-icon--system" aria-hidden="true"></span>We study the whole system, not isolated moments.</p>
        <p><span class="relate-interpretation-mobile-icon relate-interpretation-mobile-icon--testing" aria-hidden="true"></span>Our interpretations are tested, not assumed.</p>
      </div>
      <p class="relate-interpretation-boundary">The archive does not prove the hypothesis.<br><strong>It makes the hypothesis testable.</strong></p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section-shell relate-artifact-section" aria-labelledby="relate-artifact-heading">
  <figure class="relate-artifact-cover">
    <img src="/assets/media/relate/waking-aelysia-cover-approved.jpg" width="1242" height="1894" alt="Book cover for Waking Aelysia, featuring a luminous lotus on a black field." loading="lazy" decoding="async">
  </figure>
  <div class="relate-artifact-copy">
    <p class="eyebrow">Preserved provenance</p>
    <h2 id="relate-artifact-heading">An early artifact of the inquiry</h2>
    <h3>{{ publication.title }}</h3>
    <p>{{ publication.summary }}</p>
    <p>The preserved artifact makes the evolution of Hii's interpretation visible rather than retrospectively rewriting the history.</p>
    <p class="publication-boundary">{{ publication.boundary }}</p>
    {% if publication.href %}<a class="text-link" href="{{ publication.href }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">View the book <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>{% endif %}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section-shell relate-paper-document" id="current-working-paper" aria-labelledby="relate-paper-document-heading">
  <div class="paper-document-heading">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">Current research · {{ paper.version }}</p>
      <h2 id="relate-paper-document-heading">Earlier interpretation. Current methodological framework.</h2>
      <p>{{ paper.documentTitle }}</p>
      <p class="artifact-status">{{ paper.status.display }}</p>
    </div>
    <div class="paper-document-actions">
      <a class="button-link" href="{{ paper.pdfHref }}" download>Download PDF</a>
      <a class="text-link" href="{{ paper.pdfHref }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Open PDF</a>
      <a class="text-link" href="{{ inquiry.href }}">Research Inquiry</a>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="paper-document-viewer">
    <iframe class="paper-document-frame" src="{{ paper.pdfHref }}#view=FitH&toolbar=1&navpanes=0" title="{{ paper.documentTitle }} {{ paper.version }} PDF" loading="lazy"></iframe>
  </div>
  <p class="paper-document-fallback">If the embedded PDF does not load, <a href="{{ paper.pdfHref }}">open the PDF directly</a>.</p>
</section>

<section class="relate-conclusion" aria-label="Relate conclusion">
  <div class="section-shell relate-conclusion-inner">
    <p class="eyebrow">Relationship → observation → preservation → research</p>
    <div class="relate-social" aria-label="Follow Hii">
      <span class="relate-social-label">Follow us</span>
      <a class="relate-social-icon relate-social-instagram" href="{{ site.socialLinks.instagram }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="Follow Hii on Instagram"></a>
      <a class="relate-social-icon relate-social-linkedin" href="{{ site.socialLinks.linkedin }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="Follow Hii on LinkedIn">in</a>
      <a class="relate-social-icon relate-social-x" href="{{ site.socialLinks.x }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="Follow Hii on X">X</a>
    </div>
    <a class="button-link" href="/?return=hii">Return to Hii</a>
  </div>
  <div class="section-shell relate-signature">
    <img src="/assets/media/relate/hii-observatory-mark.webp" width="1100" height="1100" alt="Hii observatory mark." loading="lazy" decoding="async">
    <div>
      <p>Hybrid<br>Intelligence<br>Institute</p>
      <span>A new hello for a new world</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
